/exoplanet_mod.F90 -- analogous to operation in ExoCAM. Make modifications to
  		      SED, scon, nlevels, gravity, radiation options

/src.main          --  drivers for offline calculation and shared radiation routines
/src.misc          --  Miscellaneous files and stubs from CESM origin needed to run offline

/src.n68equiv      --  (Recommened, 8/26/2020), CO2, H2O, CH4 HITRAN2016
                       68 bins, equivalent extinction flexible overlap
/src.n84equiv      --  identical to n68equiv, but 84 bins

  Note (v2): n68equiv and n84equiv are being merged into a single src.exort
  bundle (n84 grid + NH3/CO + haze + CO2 clouds) — see REFACTOR_PLAN.md.
  The legacy bundles src.n28archean / src.n42h2o / src.n68h2o were dropped
  in v2; they remain available in the v1.0.0 tag (main branch).

/experimental      --  experimental radiative transfer builds
